---
import type { CollectionEntry } from 'astro:content';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { imageWidths } from './case-study/imageWidths';
import { appleRingAssets as assets } from '../data/apple-ring-assets';
import '../styles/apple-ring.css';
interface Props { project: CollectionEntry<'projects'> }
const { project } = Astro.props;
const href = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}work/${project.data.caseStudy!.slug}/`;
---
<article class="project-feature ring-feature" aria-labelledby="ring-feature-heading">
  <header class="feature-heading"><p class="micro">03 / Connected devices · Independent concept</p><h3 id="ring-feature-heading">{project.data.title}</h3></header>
  <div class="feature-story"><h4>Why a ring, if you already have Watch?</h4><p>Explore an overnight handoff while Watch charges. The web prototype makes the reading’s source, sync status, and missing information visible.</p><p class="project-boundary">Independent, AI-assisted concept. Not affiliated with Apple; hardware and integrations are proposed.</p></div>
  <figure class="project-visual">
    <a class="ring-feature-artifacts" href={href} aria-label="View the Apple Ring case study">
      <Image class="primary-artifact" src={assets.product.image} widths={imageWidths(assets.product.image.width)} sizes="(max-width: 40rem) 92vw, (max-width: 64rem) 45vw, 48vw" format="webp" alt={assets.product.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <Image class="supporting-artifact" src={assets.handoff.image} widths={imageWidths(assets.handoff.image.width)} sizes="(max-width: 40rem) 92vw, (max-width: 64rem) 45vw, 48vw" format="webp" alt={assets.handoff.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </a>
    <figcaption>A physical idea. An inspectable interaction.<span>AI-generated product render<span class="secondary-caption"> and capture of the coded prototype</span>.</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="feature-details feature-footer"><dl class="feature-contribution"><dt>My contribution</dt><dd>Concept direction, iterative critique, and experience refinement with AI-assisted implementation.</dd></dl><div class="project-actions"><a class="text-link" href={href}>Read the Apple Ring case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}prototypes/apple-ring/index.html`}>Explore the Ring prototype <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
</article>
